OL,3,GNEWSAWhat does severe drought mean for
OL,4,ASomerset?
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this week, the Environment
OL,7,FAgency announced parts of Cornwall,
OL,8,FDevon, Dorset, Somerset, East Sussex
OL,9,Fand West Sussex were in severe drought.
OL,11,FThe west Somerset area affected is
OL,12,Fsupplied by Wimbleball reservoir, which
OL,13,Fis currently at just 15% capacity
OL,14,Ffollowing months of low rainfall.
OL,16,FBut what does that mean for people
OL,17,Fliving in the area? And is the rest of
OL,18,Fthe county at risk of falling into
OL,19,Fsevere drought anytime soon?
OL,21,FHere is what you need to know.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
